{"id":"d67f3eb689bf34b7","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-representability-criterion.md","title":"Representability Criterion","display":"prop-representability-criterion — Representability Criterion","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-representability-criterion","aliases":["90-prop-representability-criterion"],"display":"prop-representability-criterion — Representability Criterion","depends_on":["[[90-df-provable]]","[[90-df-representation]]","[[90-df-strong-representation]]","[[90-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-representability-criterion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-representability-criterion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-representability-criterion — Representability Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"00ee901093c12d44\" href=\"?note=00ee901093c12d44\" title=\"90-df-provable\">90-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc78339b84b14c7b\" href=\"?note=cc78339b84b14c7b\" title=\"90-df-strong-representation\">90-df-strong-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d53b945955293235\" href=\"?note=d53b945955293235\" title=\"90-df-numeral\">90-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (arithmetical theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (total function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(k+1)}\">\\(\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(k+1)}\\)</span> (graph formula)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span> (strong function-representability predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}representability\\text{-}criterion}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\nT\\vdash\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline{f(\\vec n)})\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(m\\ne f(\\vec n)\\rightarrow\nT\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline m)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}representability\\text{-}criterion}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\nT\\vdash\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline{f(\\vec n)})\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(m\\ne f(\\vec n)\\rightarrow\nT\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline m)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>前两项分别给出正确图像和所有错误标准输出的逐数实例；最后一项是理论内部的全称存在唯一性。</li>\n<li>这些都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T\\)</span> 的必要后果；精确定义仍由“图关系的正负逐数表示 + 内部存在唯一性”给出。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"00ee901093c12d44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-representation","status":"resolved","id":"635265d0fe56f718","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-strong-representation","status":"resolved","id":"cc78339b84b14c7b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-strong-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"d53b945955293235","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-numeral]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi(\\vec x,y)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S^{(k+1)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}representability\\text{-}criterion}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T(f,\\varphi)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\nT\\vdash\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline{f(\\vec n)})\n\\right)\n\\land\n\\left(\n\\forall\\vec n\\in\\mathbb N^k\\;\\forall m\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(m\\ne f(\\vec n)\\rightarrow\nT\\vdash\\neg\\varphi(\\overline{\\vec n},\\overline m)\\bigr)\n\\right)\n\\land\nT\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\;\\exists!y\\;\\varphi(\\vec x,y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongRep}_T","display":false}],"bytes":1482,"backlinks":[{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-139","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-prop-creative-complete.md]]\n[[90-prop-essential-undecidable-implies.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-non-computable.md]]\n[[90-prop-kolmogorov-unbounded.md]]\n[[90-prop-omega-consistent-stronger.md